      "message": "Initially I did this, because this block threw a checked exception and this is what other try-catch blocks in this method already did.\n\nNow, since IllegalArgumentException is a runtime exception, I think it\u0027s better to just throw it and let the process crash.\n\nAs you mentioned, this can happen only if there is a bug in the test. \nIt\u0027s easier to debug a process crash, then to look through the logs looking for anything suspicious.\n\nAs for other try-catch blocks, I think it might be better to catch checked exceptions and rethrow them as runtime exceptions. I can do that in a separate CL.",
