      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s the same UID in the test, but I think strictly speaking what we want here is to check that the sending process owns the socket (as opposed to the VPN process) ? In other words, if the process sending over the socket and the VPN were not the same app in this test, we\u0027ll get the former\u0027s UID I think ?\n\nSo maybe call this \"expectSenderOwnedConnection\" ?",
